<title>NORWAY: Norway Statkraft increases Sydkraft stake.</title>
<headline>Norway Statkraft increases Sydkraft stake.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Norwegian power company Statkraft has bought 6.8 million A shares and 12.4 million C shares in the Swedish power company Sydkraft AB, the Oslo bourse said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
